; fpmacro 2
; Macro language v2 -- the player's manual check (docs/handoff/0214-report.md).
; On an EMPTY plan: Macro > Record / Debug, Load this file, Replay.
;
; 1. a wall on the grid, 10' to 30' along y = 10'
I CLICK 120 120 DRAG 360 120
; 2. Shift held for the drag: the end follows the cursor -- OFF the grid, not square
I CLICK 120 240 +DRAG 355 253
; 3. one press, the modifier changing mid-drag: the cursor goes to (300,364)
;    with no modifier, then on to (301,451) with Shift held. It is still ONE
;    wall -- a wall runs straight from the press to the release, and the
;    middle point is only where the cursor passed. It ends at (301,451), off
;    the grid, because Shift was down when the button came up.
I CLICK 120 360 DRAG 300 364 +DRAG 301 451
; 4. a door on wall 1: the size dialog opens, is typed into, and is accepted
D CLICK 240 120
TYPE 2868
KEY {Enter}
; 5. back to the select tool
S
